{"overview":{"Symbol":"PRENW","Name":"Prenetics Global Limited","Description":"Prenetics Global Limited, a health sciences company, focuses on consumer health in Hong Kong and the United States. It sells health and wellness products under the IM8 brand name; and provides fulfillment and distribution services for sports nutrition products under the Europa brand. The company is also involved in the operation of CircleDNA, a consumer genetic testing brand that uses next-generation sequencing (NGS) technology to provide insights into health, wellness, and genetic predispositions. Prenetics Global Limited was founded in 2014 and is headquartered in Quarry Bay, Hong Kong.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"Hong Kong","Sector":"","Industry":"","Address":"Unit 703-706, K11 Atelier King’s Road, Quarry Bay, Hong Kong","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"","EBITDA":"-37192000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"9.758","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-11.041","RevenuePerShareTTM":"6.575","ProfitMargin":"-0.40815","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.37157002","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.11371","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.22121","RevenueTTM":"92390000","GrossProfitTTM":"48790000","DilutedEPSTTM":"-11.041","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"","AnalystTargetPrice":"","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"","PriceToBookRatio":"0.0016396802","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"0.239","52WeekHigh":"0.016","52WeekLow":"0.016","50DayMovingAverage":"","200DayMovingAverage":"","SharesOutstanding":"","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"1.13"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"PRENW","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-06-11","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026-03-06":{"1. open":"0.01899999938905239","2. high":"0.01899999938905239","3. low":"0.01899999938905239","4. close":"0.0189999